ato paste]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* 2 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* 2 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Hot Sauce|hot sauce]]\n* [[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|Oil]] for [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|deep frying]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Sprinkle wings with salt and black pepper. \n#Heat oil to 350°F (175°C).\n#[[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|Deep fry]] wings in batches for 11–12 minutes. Drain on a [[Cookbook:Cooling Rack|cooling rack]].\n#Combine liquid ingredients except for oil.\n#Bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] over medium high heat until reduced to 10 Tbsp.\n#Remove from heat and let rest for 5 minutes.\n#[[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|Toss]] wings with sauce; serve warm.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken wing]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot sauce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Honey BBQ Hot Wings","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"24 chicken wingettes","sourceText":"24 chicken wingettes","amountText":"24 chicken wingettes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Black pepper","sourceText":"Black pepper","amountText":"Black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ cup tomato paste","sourceText":"½ cup tomato paste","amountText":"½ cup tomato paste","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 Tbsp honey","sourceText":"2 Tbsp honey","amountText":"2 Tbsp honey","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 Tbsp cider vinegar","sourceText":"2 Tbsp cider vinegar","amountText":"2 Tbsp cider vinegar","amount"